# Exact-match 410 list for root placeholder pages archived from 7a278f0.
# Load this file in the http context (Dockerfiles copy it into conf.d).
# $uri is the normalized, decoded path without the query string.
# Each page is listed with and without a trailing slash. This is not a prefix match.
# nginx map lookup is case-insensitive, so /sli and /slo also match the retired
# /SLI and /SLO aliases. Uppercase duplicates are omitted because they conflict.
